e whole page.\n\nCorrections from the comparison:\n- ten-terms.md: `dap act` prints `Took effect` (command-scope.ts:108). MCP returns `accepted`.\n- life-of-an-act.md: the saved-request journal covers `create` and `join` (line.ts:124 to 126).\n- write-an-application.md: the lane directory `definitions` holds readable JSON (lanes/scripts/pin.mjs:106 to 109). `publish-file` cannot overwrite a reserved path or a rules extent (publication-policy.ts:7).\n- deploy.md: the plan-expiry rule also covers `--register-policy open` (command-install.ts:61 to 78). The saved file is the scope-index manifest.\n- operations.md: the wiring reason `repository-bindings` (github-wiring.ts:79). An invalid INSTALLED_REGISTER_SCOPES list gives `unavailable` (health.ts:71).\n- hosts.md: `--host none` also installs under the repository-binding, own-agent and commons cohorts (command-install.ts:68 to 70). The namespace check reads ARTIFACTS_NAMESPACE only (artifacts-wiring.ts:65).\n- pages.md: with `publicReads` true, GitHub reads use no token (site/host.ts:217 to 219).\n- kernel.md and scopes.md: the catalog holds 100 versions (platform/test/versions.test.ts:204). kernel.md: `replayOf` stands in command-verify.ts, and the invitation list holds Membership 6 to 13 (contract/src/invitation.ts:3 to 7).\n- self-host-cloudflare.md: an ordinary version 2 package needs a historical `declared-application` room, not `trusted-application` (cli.md:330).\n\nChecks: the link checker reports 1214 local links, 0 broken. scripts/check-notes.mjs 810905c9 HEAD reports 0 warnings. The commit-message check passes. I ran no gate. Subagents made the page comparisons. I spot-checked the package limit, the cohort correction, the archive import, the publication policy and each new anchor.\n\nKnown and not fixed here: the section 3 table of kernel.md omits five packages and its K6 examples are stale. write-an-application.md:300 calls Counter's definition.json canonical bytes. The surface example of application-views.md